{
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dTo",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-3*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "GSC 数据滞后约 2–3 天,窗口右端必须留出这一截 —— 否则最后两三天恒为 0,曲线尾部永远是一道往下扎的假坑。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dFrom",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-31*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dHalf",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-17*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "环比的分界日:近 14 天 vs 前 14 天。"
    },
    {
      "_note": "入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SCHEMA",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ckey",
        "value": "c.gsc.home"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。",
      "id": "hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitSchema",
        "value": "${hit.schema}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "age",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 172800s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasHit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},172800000),1,0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "ttl = 3600s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},3600000),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_stale",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "sr",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": {
              "Content-Type": "application/json",
              "Accept": "application/json",
              "User-Agent": "Numable"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "credential": "google"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b0",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "errMsg",
            "value": "${sr.error.message}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sr},),0,if::(eq::(${errMsg},),1,0))]"
          },
          "_note": "请求失败两种形态:① 有的端把非 2xx 当节点失败 → resp 整个为空;② 有的端把 JSON 错误体交回来。两种都得抓 —— 不抓就会把 403 渲成「0 个站点」,而假数字比报错更险(标准 §9.5)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "total",
            "value": "$[length::(${sr.siteEntry})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tShow",
            "value": "$[if::(gt::(${total},6),6,${total})]"
          },
          "_note": "屏上最多列 6 个;`total` 仍是真实总数,页脚那句「共 N 个」用它。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm1_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k1},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k1},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k1},0,8),https://),subString::(${k1},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k1},0,7),http://),subString::(${k1},7,99),${k1})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm1_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm1_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm1_a},${nm1_n},99),/),subString::(${nm1_a},0,${nm1_n}),${nm1_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},1),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm2_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k2},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k2},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k2},0,8),https://),subString::(${k2},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k2},0,7),http://),subString::(${k2},7,99),${k2})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm2_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm2_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm2_a},${nm2_n},99),/),subString::(${nm2_a},0,${nm2_n}),${nm2_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},2),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm3_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k3},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k3},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k3},0,8),https://),subString::(${k3},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k3},0,7),http://),subString::(${k3},7,99),${k3})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm3_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm3_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm3_a},${nm3_n},99),/),subString::(${nm3_a},0,${nm3_n}),${nm3_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},3),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm4_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k4},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k4},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k4},0,8),https://),subString::(${k4},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k4},0,7),http://),subString::(${k4},7,99),${k4})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm4_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm4_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm4_a},${nm4_n},99),/),subString::(${nm4_a},0,${nm4_n}),${nm4_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},4),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm5_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k5},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k5},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k5},0,8),https://),subString::(${k5},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k5},0,7),http://),subString::(${k5},7,99),${k5})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm5_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm5_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm5",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm5_a},${nm5_n},99),/),subString::(${nm5_a},0,${nm5_n}),${nm5_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k6",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},5),siteUrl),get::(index::(${sr.siteEntry},0),siteUrl))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm6_a",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${k6},0,10),sc-domain:),subString::(${k6},10,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k6},0,8),https://),subString::(${k6},8,99),if::(eq::(subString::(${k6},0,7),http://),subString::(${k6},7,99),${k6})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm6_n",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(${nm6_a})-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm6",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(subString::(${nm6_a},${nm6_n},99),/),subString::(${nm6_a},0,${nm6_n}),${nm6_a})]"
          },
          "_note": "结尾那个 `/` 也去掉 —— `example.com/` 与 `example.com` 在一列里并排时看着像两个站。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "site",
            "value": "${k1}"
          },
          "_note": "主站点 = 列表第一个。hero 与曲线都看它。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bodyS",
            "value": "{\"startDate\":\"${dFrom}\",\"endDate\":\"${dTo}\",\"dimensions\":[],\"rowLimit\":1}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bodyD",
            "value": "{\"startDate\":\"${dFrom}\",\"endDate\":\"${dTo}\",\"dimensions\":[\"date\"],\"rowLimit\":40}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bodyH",
            "value": "{\"startDate\":\"${dHalf}\",\"endDate\":\"${dTo}\",\"dimensions\":[],\"rowLimit\":1}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bodyP",
            "value": "{\"startDate\":\"${dFrom}\",\"endDate\":\"${dHalf}\",\"dimensions\":[],\"rowLimit\":1}"
          },
          "_note": "前 14 天(用于 hero 的环比)。⚠️ 两段用**同样的汇总口径**,别拿逐日求和去比 —— 平均排名是按曝光加权的,自己求和会得到对不上的数。"
        },
        {
          "action": "concurrent",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k1})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k2})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "s3",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k3})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "s4",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k4})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "s5",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k5})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "s6",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${k6})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyS}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "day",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${site})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyD}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hA",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${site})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyH}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hB",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://searchconsole.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/$[urlEncode::(${site})]/searchAnalytics/query",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "Accept": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable"
                },
                "body": "${bodyP}",
                "formatType": "json",
                "credential": "google"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b1",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${s1},),0,if::(eq::(${s1.error.message},),1,0))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m1r",
            "value": "${s1.rows[0]}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m1nd",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${m1r.impressions},__none__),__none__),1,0),0)]"
          },
          "_note": "一行搜索数据都没有(新站点头 2–3 天):屏上说「还没有搜索数据」,不渲 0。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m1clicks",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),round::(findNotEmpty::(${m1r}.clicks,0)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m1imps",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),round::(findNotEmpty::(${m1r}.impressions,0)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m1ctrN",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${m1r}.ctr,0)*100),0.0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
